{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act34side_level_act34side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act34side",
  "stageId": "act34side_04",
  "title": "犧牲與代價",
  "storyCode": "BP-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act34side/level_act34side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b1da33325645feaffbd567765efa1c9e4a1fbf6fdd6d56c912e630ddd484433d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g8_oldinstitute"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小幫手”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "檢測結果更新，手術室的生物安全條件達到可接受水準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小幫手”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "手術隨時可以開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "獵人們，和以前一樣，你們會在自動化手術中保持深度睡眠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在此之外，我會手動修補你們體內老化的自適應接點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這滿屋子的標本，還有這些實驗台，真是熟悉的布置。距離我們上次躺在這樣的環境中，已經過了多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "五年，勞倫緹娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本應等到髓質替換手術的全套流程結束，你的體細胞與源石融合率得到控制，再去處理你作為深海獵人的那部分問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但時間倉促，我只好盡可能幫你恢復應有的穩定狀態。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，勞倫緹娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您還是那麼多愁善感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，按照老規矩……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你的身旁點亮一根蠟燭，讓我們的小美人魚睡著時看起來別太蒼白。我已經讓他們準備好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您果然還記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小幫手”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "休眠溶膠填注中，請您保持舒適的姿勢，不要移動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在這個情景，跟以前差不多。除了人少了很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "解決完海溝裡那些雜碎，閉上眼睛，聽聽顧問的嘮叨，泡進休眠溶膠，睡上一覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到睡醒，殘留在身上的那些令人作嘔的味道就全都消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在惡劣多變的陸地環境裡長期無人照管，你們的身體狀況非常不穩定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自適應接點能自主監視你們體內的海嗣基因，但五年的磨損足以讓最精密的儀器變得遲鈍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，在長時間與海嗣基因相抗爭的過程中，你們身體的免疫系統也難免失調。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會盡可能讓你們恢復到最佳狀態，不過這五年歲月拿走的東西，我可就找不回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭，我們在評議會上的接觸並不愉快，我更願意將此時此刻，當作你們回到家鄉後，你我的第一次見面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你從剛剛開始，一直沒怎麼說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布蘭都斯，關於這場手術，你是否還有什麼其他的事項需要交代？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有的話，更多的話題就留在之後——關於這五年來，我們發生了怎樣的變化，以及，你發生了怎樣的變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“小幫手”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請保持靜止，休眠程式將在十秒後啟動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，祝好眠，獵人們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布蘭都斯顧問，有些情況需要您重新確認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是說過了，手術室已經封鎖，接下來我要為獵人們修補自適應接點，任何人都不得打擾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中控層發現了異樣，保險起見，您還是親自確認一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……稍等，我幫你們開門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g4_aegirstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "穹頂上的監測系統對城市進行了緊急掃描，在這裡發現了密集的藻類生物訊號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝你通知我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圖利婭的調查你既然已經參與，沒有中途退出的道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地面與穹頂的交界處……這裡原本是行道珊瑚的試驗田。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然比不上生態藝術創作所的專業環境，但相比私人房間內的小型水培箱，這裡確實更適合藻類培育。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許是性格使然，又或者動機不純，圖利婭始終沒有藉由正規渠道申請過場地，她私自找到了這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圖利婭……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們並不清楚具體的情況，裡面是否是深海教會的藏身之所，圖利婭又是否身處其中……總之，要小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一隊已經在附近的街區布防，對道路進行監視。艾麗妮，你跟著二隊，從地面的道路突入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於與穹頂夾層連通的這條路，交給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g5_aegirstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海巡隊隊員",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "西昆妲指揮官，你那邊發生了什麼，是否需要增援？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "有人擋在了她的面前，準確說，是她出現在了對方離開的路上。\n對方身處建築夾角形成的陰影當中，全身上下與陰影同色，唯有那雙眼睛，那雙西昆妲再熟悉不過的眼睛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……按照原計劃行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "西昆妲掐斷了通訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好久不見，“老師”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g8_oldinstitute"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員A”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1397_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "航道計劃的武器技術顧問，第Ⅳ級武器的研發專家，布蘭都斯，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你們不是研究所的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員A”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1397_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別亂動。如果被這株長鬚櫛齒草的觸鬚刺破皮膚，你很快就會墜入混沌的夢境，慢慢感受自己的意識是如何被撕碎的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員A”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1397_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們現在用來提供安樂死的是馴化過的品種，但野生原種的效果就要殘酷得多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員A”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1397_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然你看起來已經是半死的人了，但我很清楚，你們這種人最在意自己的死法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深海教會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要驚擾到休眠中的獵人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員A”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1397_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真難得，自己的生命安全受到威脅，您第一時間關心的依然是這幾個獵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員B”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您關愛她們，卻從未信任過深海獵人計劃本身，您質疑它的合理性，質疑它對人性的傷害，質疑它所帶來的犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員B”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您參與其中，也不過是為了能親自把控其中的種種風險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員B”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您親身經歷了它的破產，見證了這樣一個牽連甚廣的計劃在一場疑點重重的失敗後被草草畫上句號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員B”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，我很疑惑，倖存的獵人才剛剛回到阿戈爾，您就要親手將她們重新送上戰場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你們這些人怎麼會明白，我要做的，只是讓她們不再受到傷害……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員B”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那為何不停止這台手術，阻止她們參與航道計劃的作戰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "手術的所有設備都是自動運行的，我沒辦法主動停止……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員A”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1397_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切斷手術台下的氧氣供應管線，就能強行中斷手術，別以為我們不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員A”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1397_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你不願意動手，我們可以代勞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員B”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "顧問，解決完獵人們，您還得跟我們走一趟，向我們講解一下第Ⅳ級武器的實現原理，以及它的關停方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住手！手術流程如果強行中斷，獵人們會受到不可逆的損傷……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "渣滓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“研究員”停在了原地，他不敢前進，也不敢後退，長槊刺入了他的胸口，鮮血淋漓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員B”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不想胸膛被捅穿的話，鬆開你的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g5_aegirstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你為什麼出現在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要提無效的問題，西昆妲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也在調查圖利婭，你發現了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個資料分析師只是一個被牽連的普通人。她發現了她本不該發現的異常，嘗試向相關人員示警，但沒能成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你慢了一步，她的遭遇與她的過往無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城外的戰鬥，城內的異動，海巡隊置身於航道計劃之外，你注意到了足夠多的異常，但同時也被如此輕易地干擾了視線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說……卡西婭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你原本是一個專注的人，也很敏銳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以當年你提出離開深海獵人研究所，加入海巡隊時，我相信你的確經過了審慎的思考，選擇了一個同樣適合自己的領域。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少，那不應該只是一次意氣用事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……五年的時間，除了這身裝扮之外，你甚至連說話的方式都沒怎麼變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論是研究員還是獵人，你從不拒絕學生們向你提問，但又從不回答在你看來錯誤的問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有無效的答案，決定答案價值的是問題本身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提問是鍛鍊思考最有效的方式，而你的問題向來準確，西昆妲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我的第一個問題並沒有錯——烏爾比安，你為什麼出現在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是海巡隊調查案件的現場，一個隱匿行蹤的深海獵人，此時此刻應該放下手中的錨，表明自己的立場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭她們已經作為有生力量參與航道計劃的作戰，你還活著，卻選擇以這樣的方式回到彌利亞留姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我已經有充足的理由對你發起攻擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她們三人的回歸只會讓局勢變得更加混亂。從圖利婭的事情不難看出，所謂的航道計劃早已千瘡百孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿戈爾並沒有從深海獵人計劃的失敗中汲取任何教訓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底想做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阻止這個國家滑向深淵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你現在看起來，更像是我們的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨你懷疑，西昆妲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（尖利的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "裡面發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個普通的阿戈爾人，做了她能做的所有事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但阿戈爾已不會對她致以任何敬意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾麗妮……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏爾比安？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沒有人回答她，獵人已經消失在了陰影裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g8_oldinstitute"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員B”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼回事，為什麼你沒有進入休眠？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不只我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“研究員A”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1397_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1397_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，把你拎著那什麼草的手慢慢地從顧問脖子上移開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你，\n呃啊——\n一隻白皙的手緊緊握住了“研究員”手上的植物，植物發光的觸鬚激烈地掙扎，然後一根根被掐斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說了讓你慢慢移開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "研究員們都在器械回收間，應該是被注射了麻痺藥物，要等一會才能醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外面走廊裡的那些傢伙我已經解決了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你留了活口吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "起碼在海巡隊來帶走他們之前，死不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭、勞倫緹娜、斯卡蒂……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "布蘭都斯站在手術室的中央，深海獵人們跨過躺倒在地上的不速之客，向他走過來。\n深海獵人們沒有放下武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "顧問，你不想解釋一下你在溶膠上做的手腳嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，親愛的顧問，我們當然沒有未卜先知的能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劍魚從一開始就發現了蹊蹺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們接受過起碼上百次手術，躺在這些溶膠裡的時間，可能比躺在床上的時間都要長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你應該知道，哪怕手術沒有讓我們的身體恢復至應有的狀態，我們依然會選擇回到戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當初烏爾比安找到我的時候，我就說過，我只想讓這個計劃的參與者能夠全身而退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望那些來自各行各業的同胞最終能夠回歸原本的人生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂可以繼續享受她的漫遊生活，一邊敲打燈光陣列複雜的元件，一邊拍下除了她自己之外沒人能懂的海底影像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以勞倫緹娜的天資，或許她會成為形體藝術研究所新一代的翹楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們將曼妙的星空投影在穹頂上，而她在鬥智場裡隨流星起舞……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者，在每一座城市的街頭巷尾豎起她的雕塑作品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "浮藻培育技術員弗拉維奧、作曲家諾娜、特種生物研究員盧妮婭，還有那個最年輕的科考艦隊的艦長克里索……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭，你我都還記得那些獵人們的名字。我們已經經歷了太多犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這一套陳詞濫調我已經從你口中聽過許多次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布蘭都斯，你的愚蠢和軟弱差點讓你死在我的槊下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，這些深海教會的渣滓來得正是時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說他們碰巧證明了我的清白嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不需要，歌蕾蒂婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要做的事情不會變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的清白並不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的意思是，這些渣滓選擇在此時暴露自己，冒險阻止獵人們參與作戰，甚至劫持作為武器技術顧問的你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恰好說明航道計劃的部署是有效的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布蘭都斯，航道計劃的武器技術顧問，收起你的小手段，替我們完成手術，然後回到你原本的崗位上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照克萊門莎的布置，一旦實現對第三十七號巢穴的定位，第Ⅳ級武器便會立刻對航道沿途的所有巢穴進行打擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深海教會已經在做最後一搏，從剛剛那幫渣滓的話中不難猜出，他們的動作不會停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布蘭都斯，深海獵人計劃已經不存在了，如果對舊情的牽掛讓你變得軟弱，那麼，忘記它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭都斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1381_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還是像以前一樣。不，甚至相比以前，對自己更加嚴厲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這與我的自我要求沒有任何關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一天前，兩支艦隊，我們僅僅從海嗣的包圍圈中救回二十六人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而在到達這間舊研究所之前，我剛剛得知，那二十六位軍團士兵已經申請加入了新的作戰部隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰爭不停，便沒有戰士能夠從戰場中脫身。僅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g11_aegirroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——海嗣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "穹頂與地面相接的地方，一整面牆壁都陳列著被改造過的水培箱。不同種類的海藻肆意生長，有些體積較大的團簇已經蔓延出箱壁。\n隔著透明的牆壁，它們與昏暗的海水相望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（模糊的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一隻海嗣孤零零地遊蕩著，像是迷途的幽靈。\n它上身的觸肢緊緊纏住一個透明的容器，剩下的部分搖搖晃晃地拖動身體朝水培箱的方向移動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這笨拙的姿勢……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（它似乎還不太習慣這副軀體。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你是——\n圖利婭？\n圖——利——婭……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還能說話……你還保留著人類的意識，告訴我，你經歷了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離開……又回來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "數據。有人利用……航道，訊號……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我告訴，她。但她……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海洋……掉進——海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城市開走。你們、它們還在……這裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚，好遠——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾麗妮，離她遠一點。海嗣細胞已經完全同化了她的身體，她的理智所剩無幾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們處理過許多類似的變異體，這個階段的海嗣狀態極不穩定，已經超出了我們能給予臨終關懷的最大限度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你來得好慢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遇到了一點事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們被誤導了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人故意引導我們去懷疑資料分析師的過往與參與航道計劃的動機，干擾調查的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是說，設施管理所的那位女性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，卡西婭。等到處理完這裡，海巡隊會告知設施管理所，對她實施逮捕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圖利婭偶然發現了訊號系統的異常，她告訴了身邊的朋友，或許就是卡西婭……她將自己直接暴露在了深海教會面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在深海教會的誘導與圍堵下來到城市邊緣，從邊緣循環系統的排水口墜入海洋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還記得此前在城外，我們發現的生物組織碎片嗎？不依靠任何裝置跨越兩個停泊點，這已經超越了人類的生理極限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了重新回到城市……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她吃下了異種的血肉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（模糊不清的低鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她懷裡抱著的是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "植物營養液。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的意識應該已經支離破碎，返回城市，難道只是為了……這些海藻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“這些原始藻類是整片海洋裡最簡單，卻也最頑強的生命。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“不論明亮的淺海，還是無光的深淵，不論平滑的海床，還是斷崖的夾縫，它們都在努力地舒展身軀。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“它們與海洋同歲，是這顆星球的活化石。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（劇烈地顫抖）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（痛苦的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "海嗣突然停了下來，它像是突然發現了什麼，觸肢胡亂地揮舞著，透明的容器從它的觸肢間滑落，營養液灑了一地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生物雷達的讀數在激增——她的海嗣化進程在加速！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她為什麼突然停了下來，發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾麗妮走到了海嗣的身後。\n透過水培箱的玻璃，艾麗妮看到了自己的臉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我想……她看見了自己此刻的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……資料分析師，或許是個和海藻一樣簡單的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "選擇留下來，或許只是因為她知道，隨生態藝術創作所遷去其他城市，並不能真正救下這些逐漸在海洋裡失去容身之所的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但現在……她自己成了那個污染源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾麗妮閉上了眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她並不認識這位喜歡海藻的阿戈爾人，只是在小幫手的影像中見過她的樣子，真正見面時，她便已經是眼前這隻海嗣。\n劍也好，手炮也好，她應該結束它的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g11_aegirroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，她已經無法回答我們任何問題了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你似乎對眼前的情形並不陌生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我曾經在一艘船上，聽見過海嗣彈起一段破碎的歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾麗妮，我為之前對你的輕視致歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海洋與陸地相連，或許你沒有經歷過與海嗣的正面戰爭，但你見證過的那些變化與不曾變化的事物，同樣殘忍而厚重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但此時此刻，這裡還是交給我處理吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是阿戈爾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾麗妮看著西昆妲從自己身側經過，走到海嗣的面前。\n沒什麼表情的海巡隊指揮官將盾牌擋在了海嗣與滿牆的水培箱之間，然後向著對方舉起了手中的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1388_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哀鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的旅程結束♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的家鄉近在眼前♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這首歌……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她選擇在此間睡去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "海嗣倒在了地上，有指揮官的盾牌擋著，迸射的海嗣體液沒有濺到水培箱上。\n那些海藻只是搖曳著，安靜地呼吸著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "aliases": [
        "斯卡蒂"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
